s:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/example.com\\\\\\/result1\\\",\\n        \\\"source\\\":\\\"example.com\\\",\\n        \\\"date\\\":\\\"2025-11-28\\\",\\n        \\\"snippet\\\":\\\"This is a comprehensive snippet for the search result about future trends in manufacturing industry 2023-2026. It provides detailed information and context relevant to the query.\\\"\\n      }\\n    ]\\n  },\\n  {\\n    \\\"title\\\": \\\"Future Trends in Manufacturing Industry 2023-2026: Article 2\\\",\\n    \\\"summary\\\":\\\"Discussion of manufacturing trends anticipated between 2023-2026, including the widespread application of advanced technologies in production processes, sustainable manufacturing practices, additive manufacturing, and improvements in supply chain management. These changes indicate the evolution of the industry and its adaptation to meet changing client requirements and technological innovation.\\\",\\n    \\\"tags\\\": [\\\"Manufacturing\\\", \\\"Future Trends\\\", \\\"2023-2026\\\"],\\n    \\\"citations\\\": [\\n      {\\n        \\\"title\\\": \\\"Relevant Result 2 for: future trends in manufacturing industry 2023-2026\\\",\\n        \\\"url\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/example.com\\\\\\/result2\\\",\\n        \\\"source\\\":\\\"example.com\\\",\\n        \\\"date\\\":\\\"2025-11-11\\\",\\n        \\\"snippet\\\":\\\"This is a comprehensive snippet for the search result about future trends in manufacturing industry 2023-2026. It provides detailed information and context relevant to the query.\\\"\\n      }\\n    ]\\n  },\\n  {\\n    \\\"title\\\": \\\"Future Trends in Manufacturing Industry 2023-2026: Article 3\\\",\\n    \\\"summary\\\":\\\"Overview of anticipated trends in the manufacturing sector from 2023-2026. The key drivers of these trends include the usage of advanced technology in production, increased emphasis on sustainability, adoption of additive manufacturing, and progressive improvement in supply chain management. These shifts reveal an industry that is revamping itself in response to changing consumer expectations and advances in technology.\\\",\\n    \\\"tags\\\": [\\\"Manufacturing\\\", \\\"Future Trends\\\", \\\"2023-2026\\\"],\\n    \\\"citations\\\": [\\n      {\\n        \\\"title\\\": \\\"Relevant Result 3 for: future trends in manufacturing industry 2023-2026\\\",\\n        \\\"url\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/example.com\\\\\\/result3\\\",\\n        \\\"source\\\":\\\"example.com\\\",\\n        \\\"date\\\":\\\"2026-01-24\\\",\\n        \\\"snippet\\\":\\\"This is a comprehensive snippet for the search result about future trends in manufacturing industry 2023-2026. It provides detailed information and context relevant to the query.\\\"\\n      }\\n    ]\\n  },\\n  {\\n    \\\"title\\\": \\\"Future Trends in Manufacturing Industry 2023-2026: Article 4\\\",\\n    \\\"summary\\\":\\\"Analysis of future trends set to impact the manufacturing industry from 2023-2026. Such trends chiefly comprise the adoption of innovative technologies in production, the rise of additive manufacturing, a stronger focus on sustainability, and comprehensive enhancements in supply chain management. The industry appears to be in a state of constant change, recalibrating in response to shifting consumer demands and technological progress.\\\",\\n    \\\"tags\\\": [\\\"Manufacturing\\\", \\\"Future Trends\\\", \\\"2023-2026\\\"],\\n    \\\"citations\\\": [\\n      {\\n        \\\"title\\\": \\\"Relevant Result 4 for: future trends in manufacturing industry 2023-2026\\\",\\n        \\\"url\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/example.com\\\\\\/result4\\\",\\n        \\\"source\\\":\\\"example.com\\\",\\n        \\\"date\\\":\\\"2025-11-11\\\",\\n        \\\"snippet\\\":\\\"This is a comprehensive snippet for the search result about future trends in manufacturing industry 2023-2026. It provides detailed information and context relevant to the query.\\\"\\n      }\\n    ]\\n  }\\n]}\",\"refusal\":null,\"annotations\":[]},\"logprobs\":null,\"finish_reason\":\"stop\"}],\"usage\":{\"prompt_tokens\":871,\"completion_tokens\":881,\"total_tokens\":1752,\"prompt_tokens_details\":{\"cached_tokens\":0,\"audio_tokens\":0},\"completion_tokens_details\":{\"reasoning_tokens\":0,\"audio_tokens\":0,\"accepted_prediction_tokens\":0,\"rejected_prediction_tokens\":0}},\"service_tier\":\"default\",\"system_fingerprint\":null}',NULL,NULL,'1',871,881,78989,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,1,'planner-phase3-e731e43d-0946-4b95-a056-b370bd430bb8-1769474477','2026-01-27 00:41:19','2026-01-27 00:41:49'),('5cfbfdf1-6f0c-4b0f-86d1-d04a7c701700','a38c0b3c-9f4b-4b47-a1bc-e03e2380cd57',NULL,'gpt-4.1','completed','Act as a Research & Insights Lead conducting Phase 4 (Validation) of a content-aligned B2B research workflow.\nTopic: Manufacturing\nContext from Phase 3 Deep Dive:\nThe manufacturing industry in 2024 is undergoing an accelerated digital transformation, with AI, smart manufacturing, and e-commerce at the forefront. These trends are being shaped by workforce shortages, sustainability concerns, evolving pricing strategies, and ongoing supply chain challenges. Actionable insights and data reveal where the greatest innovations—and disruptions—are occurring, with implications for Field Service, Spare Parts, and B2B commerce.\nFocus level: 50 (0 = general, 100 = focused). Validate 5–7 topics and discard weak signals.\nYour job is to validate, refine, or eliminate topics based on accuracy, authority, and editorial confidence.\nStress-test Phase 3 topics against authoritative, recent sources. Attach only citations that are safe to quote.\nWhere applicable, map back to keyword signals identified in Phase 2 to preserve strategic alignment.\nReturn ONLY valid JSON. Do not include commentary or apologies.\nSchema: {\n\"validation_summary\":\"\",\n\"validated_topics\":[{\"topic\":\"\",\"validated_insights\":[\"\"],\"trend_maturity\":\"emerging|growing|mainstream\",\"relevance_score\":0.0,\"confidence_score\":0.0,\"keywords\":[\"\"],\"citations\":[{\"title\":\"\",\"url\":\"\",\"source\":\"\",\"date\":\"\",\"snippet\":\"\"}]}],\n\"discarded_topics\":[{\"topic\":\"\",\"reason\":\"Outdated trend / insufficient supporting evidence / low editorial value\"}],\n\"next_step_question\":\"Ready to generate article synopses?\"\n}','{\"id\":\"chatcmpl-D393ZUjyJab21e0ayZpeCp5Fmvcx5\",\"object\":\"chat.completion\",\"created\":1769642169,\"model\":\"gpt-4.1-2025-04-14\",\"choices\":[{\"index\":0,\"message\":{\"role\":\"assistant\",\"content\":\"{\\n  \\\"validation_summary\\\": \\\"The validation phase confirms the centrality of AI, smart manufacturing, and workforce transformation in shaping manufacturing in 2024, with supported evidence on sustainability and supply chain resiliency. E-commerce and evolving pricing hold some influence, but trends like predictive maintenance, servitization, and additive manufacturing are more salient than general B2B pricing shifts. Field service and spare parts transformations are strongly linked to digital innovation and digital twins.\\\",\\n  \\\"validated_topics\\\": [\\n    {\\n      \\\"topic\\\": \\\"AI-driven automation and smart manufacturing\\\",\\n      \\\"validated_insights\\\": [\\n        \\\"AI adoption is mainstreaming, driving efficiency through automation, predictive maintenance, and quality control.\\\",\\n        \\\"Smart factories and digital twins are prominent, with 83% of manufacturers expecting significant transformation in the next five years.\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"trend_maturity\\\": \\\"mainstream\\\",\\n      \\\"relevance_score\\\": 0.95,\\n      \\\"confidence_score\\\": 0.96,\\n      \\\"keywords\\\": [\\\"AI\\\", \\\"smart manufacturing\\\", \\\"digital twins\\\", \\\"automation\\\", \\\"predictive maintenance\\\"],\\n      \\\"citations\\\": [\\n        {\\n          \\\"title\\\": \\\"2024 manufacturing industry outlook\\\",\\n          \\\"url\\\": \\\"https:\\/\\/www.deloitte.com\\/us\\/en\\/insights\\/industry\\/manufacturing-industrial-products\\/manufactu