d a drive for sustainability, with challenges and opportunities\\u2026\",\"prioritized_topics\":[{\"topic\":\"Automation in Manufacturing\",\"why_now\":\"Surging investments post-pandemic and escalating labor shortages make automation key for productivity and resilience.\",\"key_findings\":[\"Global industrial robot numbers grew 30% YoY, now at 3.5 million units.\",\"Automation reduces human error, labor costs, and increases efficiency in repetitive or hazardous tasks.\"],\"citations\":[{\"title\":\"Automation in Manufacturing: Uses, Examples, Trends\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.unleashedsoftware.com\\/blog\\/automation-in-manufacturing\\/\",\"source\":\"Unleashed Software\",\"date\":\"2023-02-15\"}],\"keywords\":[\"automation in manufacturing\",\"industrial robots\",\"fixed automation\"],\"content_opportunity\":\"Showcase manufacturing automation use cases, differentiating automation types and ROI with recent robotics data.\"},{\"topic\":\"Industrial IoT (IIoT) in Manufacturing\",\"why_now\":\"IIoT is central to real-time operational visibility, smart maintenance, and safer, more efficient factories.\",\"key_findings\":[\"IIoT connects industrial sensors, devices, and applications for data-driven insights and control.\",\"Predictive maintenance and real-time analytics improve uptime and operational safety.\"],\"citations\":[{\"title\":\"What Is Industrial IoT (IIoT)?\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.cisco.com\\/site\\/us\\/en\\/learn\\/topics\\/industrial-iot\\/what-is-industrial-iot.html\",\"source\":\"Cisco\",\"date\":\"2025-11-06\"}],\"keywords\":[\"industrial IoT\",\"predictive maintenance\",\"real-time analytics\"],\"content_opportunity\":\"Detail IIoT architectures, benefits to field service, and new security imperatives in manufacturing environments.\"},{\"topic\":\"B2B E-Commerce in Manufacturing\",\"why_now\":\"Digital sales have accelerated, driving efficiency and reshaping supply chain and spare parts processes.\",\"key_findings\":[\"In 2022, $1.676 trillion (