 insights include the accelerating role of AI and automation, growth in self-service options, increased reliance on predictive analytics, growing focus on technician experience, and the mainstreaming of remote and mobile-first field service models.\\\",\\n  \\\"validated_topics\\\": [\\n    {\\n      \\\"topic\\\": \\\"AI and Automation in Field Service\\\",\\n      \\\"validated_insights\\\": [\\n        \\\"Adoption of AI and automation is rapidly transforming diagnostics, scheduling, routing, and customer communication in field service.\\\",\\n        \\\"AI is being used for intelligent job assignment, inventory management, and predictive analytics for maintenance.\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"trend_maturity\\\": \\\"growing\\\",\\n      \\\"relevance_score\\\": 9,\\n      \\\"confidence_score\\\": 9,\\n      \\\"keywords\\\": [\\\"AI\\\", \\\"automation\\\", \\\"scheduling\\\", \\\"predictive analytics\\\", \\\"intelligent routing\\\"],\\n      \\\"citations\\\": [\\n        {\\n          \\\"title\\\": \\\"5 Key Field Service Management Trends for 2024\\\",\\n          \\\"url\\\": \\\"https:\\/\\/www.ptc.com\\/en\\/blogs\\/service\\/field-service-management-trends-2024-future-insights\\\",\\n          \\\"source\\\": \\\"PTC\\\",\\n          \\\"date\\\": \\\"2024-08-14\\\",\\n          \\\"snippet\\\": \\\"New field service trends are emerging that are reshaping the future of the service industry, driving revenue growth and accelerating productivity...\\\"\\n        },\\n        {\\n          \\\"title\\\": \\\"Top Field Service Management Technology Trends for 2024\\\",\\n          \\\"url\\\": \\\"https:\\/\\/www.servicepower.com\\/resources\\/whitepapers-ebooks\\/2024-top-field-service-management-trends\\\",\\n          \\\"source\\\": \\\"ServicePower\\\",\\n          \\\"date\\\": \\\"2024\\\",\\n          \\\"snippet\\\": \\\"AI and machine learning, intelligent automation, predictive analytics among dominant industry trends.\\\"\\n        }\\n      ]\\n