"index\":0,\"message\":{\"role\":\"assistant\",\"content\":\"```json\\n{\\n  \\\"article_summary\\\": \\\"Manufacturing is rapidly transforming through automation, digitalization, and a drive for sustainability, with challenges and opportunities across workforce, supply chain, and digital commerce.\\\",\\n  \\\"prioritized_topics\\\": [\\n    {\\n      \\\"topic\\\": \\\"Automation in Manufacturing\\\",\\n      \\\"why_now\\\": \\\"Surging investments post-pandemic and escalating labor shortages make automation key for productivity and resilience.\\\",\\n      \\\"key_findings\\\": [\\n        \\\"Global industrial robot numbers grew 30% YoY, now at 3.5 million units.\\\",\\n        \\\"Automation reduces human error, labor costs, and increases efficiency in repetitive or hazardous tasks.\\\",\\n        \\\"Types include fixed, programmable, and flexible automation, each serving different scales and product mixes.\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"citations\\\": [\\n        {\\n          \\\"title\\\": \\\"Automation in Manufacturing: Uses, Examples, Trends\\\",\\n          \\\"url\\\": \\\"https:\\/\\/www.unleashedsoftware.com\\/blog\\/automation-in-manufacturing\\/\\\",\\n          \\\"source\\\": \\\"Unleashed Software\\\",\\n          \\\"date\\\": \\\"2023-02-15\\\",\\n          \\\"snippet\\\": \\\"There are around 3.5 million industrial robots in operation globally, with demand surging since the pandemic.\\\"\\n        },\\n        {\\n          \\\"title\\\": \\\"The Rise of Automation in Manufacturing\\\",\\n          \\\"url\\\": \\\"https:\\/\\/plex.rockwellautomation.com\\/en-us\\/platform\\/manufacturing-automation\\/rise-automation-manufacturing.html\\\",\\n          \\\"source\\\": \\\"Rockwell Automation | Plex\\\",\\n          \\\"date\\\": \\\"2024\\\",\\n          \\\"snippet\\\": \\\"Automation increases efficiency and reduces costs, allowing labor to focus on strategic oversight.\\\"\\n        }\\n      ],\\n      \\\"keywords\\\": [\\\"automation in m