ervice organisations evolve into profitable, scalable business units.\r\n\r\nAs Editor-in-Chief, Kris leads the editorial vision of Service Business Review, ensuring rigorous analysis, independent commentary, and practical relevance for executives responsible for service delivery, service revenue, and customer outcomes. He is also an experienced moderator, interviewer, and contributor to industry events, research programmes, and executive-level discussions.'),(680,177,'_author_bio','field_author_bio'),(681,177,'author_photo','178'),(682,177,'_author_photo','field_author_photo'),(683,177,'_edit_lock','1767474991:1'),(686,179,'footnotes',''),(690,180,'footnotes',''),(692,181,'_elementor_edit_mode','builder'),(693,181,'_elementor_template_type','single-post'),(694,181,'_elementor_version','3.34.0'),(695,181,'_elementor_pro_version','3.34.0'),(696,181,'_wp_page_template','default'),(697,181,'_elementor_data','[{\"id\":\"b5ef26e\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"flex_direction\":\"row\",\"flex_gap\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":0,\"column\":\"0\",\"row\":\"0\"},\"content_width\":\"full\",\"flex_justify_content\":\"flex-start\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"d62775f\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"flex_direction\":\"column\",\"content_width\":\"full\",\"width\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":14.832000000000001},\"_flex_size\":\"none\",\"_element_width\":\"initial\"},\"elements\":[],\"isInner\":true},{\"id\":\"b04a011\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"flex_direction\":\"column\",\"content_width\":\"full\",\"width\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":48.944000000000003},\"_flex_size\":\"none\",\"_element_width\":\"initial\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"f224b69\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"shortcode\":\"[post_meta_block]\\n\",\"_element_width\":\"initial\",\"_element_custom_width\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":123.614},\"_flex_size\":\"none\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"shortcode\"},{\"id\":\"711e143\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"__dynamic__\":{\"image