 viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M272 157.1v197.8c0 10.7-13 16.1-20.5 8.5l-98.3-98.9c-4.7-4.7-4.7-12.2 0-16.9l98.3-98.9c7.5-7.7 20.5-2.3 20.5 8.4zM448 80v352c0 26.5-21.5 48-48 48H48c-26.5 0-48-21.5-48-48V80c0-26.5 21.5-48 48-48h352c26.5 0 48 21.5 48 48zm-48 346V86c0-3.3-2.7-6-6-6H54c-3.3 0-6 2.7-6 6v340c0 3.3 2.7 6 6 6h340c3.3 0 6-2.7 6-6z\"></path></svg>			\n									Back to Your Dashboard\n					</a>\n						[khm_portal_account show_profile=\"yes\" show_avatar=\"yes\" show_password=\"yes\" show_email_prefs=\"no\" accent_color=\"#6b0b0b\"]','Elementor #241','','inherit','closed','closed','','241-revision-v1','','','2026-01-08 13:54:30','2026-01-08 13:54:30','',241,'http://touchpoint-template-remote.local/?p=243',0,'revision','',0),(244,1,'2026-01-08 13:54:31','2026-01-08 13:54:31','<a href=\"http://touchpoint-template-remote.local/members-portal/\">\n				<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M272 157.1v197.8c0 10.7-13 16.1-20.5 8.5l-98.3-98.9c-4.7-4.7-4.7-12.2 0-16.9l98.3-98.9c7.5-7.7 20.5-2.3 20.5 8.4zM448 80v352c0 26.5-21.5 48-48 48H48c-26.5 0-48-21.5-48-48V80c0-26.5 21.5-48 48-48h352c26.5 0 48 21.5 48 48zm-48 346V86c0-3.3-2.7-6-6-6H54c-3.3 0-6 2.7-6 6v340c0 3.3 2.7 6 6 6h340c3.3 0 6-2.7 6-6z\"></path></svg>			\n									Back to Your Dashboard\n					</a>\n						[khm_portal_account show_profile=\"yes\" show_avatar=\"yes\" show_password=\"yes\" show_email_prefs=\"no\" accent_color=\"#6b0b0b\"]','Elementor #241','','inherit','closed','closed','','241-revision-v1','','','2026-01-08 13:54:31','2026-01-08 13:54:31','',241,'http://touchpoint-template-remote.local/?p=244',0,'revision','',0),(245,1,'2026-01-08 13:54:31','2026-01-08 13:54:31','<a href=\"http://touchpoint-template-remote.local/members-portal/\">\n				<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M272 157.1v197.8c0 10.7-13 16.1-20.5 8.5l-98.3-98.9c-4.7-4.7-4.7-12.